+    You can specify a ``key_transform`` callable that is applied to
+    each group key before it is returned. Grouping and sorting still
+    use the original value; only the displayed key is transformed.
+
+    .. sourcecode:: jinja
+
+        <ul>{% for month, items in posts|groupby(
+            "date", key_transform=format_month) %}
+          <li>{{ month }}: {{ items|map(attribute="title")|join(", ") }}</li>
+        {% endfor %}</ul>
+
+    Set ``reverse`` to ``True`` to sort the groups in descending order
+    instead of ascending order.
+
+    .. sourcecode:: jinja
+
+        <ul>{% for year, items in posts|groupby("year", reverse=True) %}
+          <li>{{ year }}: {{ items|map(attribute="title")|join(", ") }}</li>
+        {% endfor %}</ul>
+
+    .. versionchanged:: 3.1
+        Added the ``key_transform`` and ``reverse`` parameters.
+
     .. versionchanged:: 3.0
         Added the ``default`` parameter.
 
